hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1677","###\n Narrated to us by Al-Abbas ibn al-Ala', narrated to us by Sufyan, who said: \I memorized this from Az-Zuhri.\"" [And another chain:] Narrated to us by Ali ibn Khashram"," informed us by Ibn Uyaynah. [And another chain:] Narrated to us by Yahya ibn Hakim and Sa'id ibn Abdur-Rahman"," they said: Narrated to us by Sufyan"," from Az-Zuhri"," from Salim"," from his father ("""
